<% content_for :title, "Styleguide" %>

<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
  <h1 class="text-hero">Styleguide</h1>
  <p>This database holds no styleguide group with an event in every state the page draws: either it was never seeded, or the seed is old enough that its ongoing event has ended. <code>bin/rails db:seed:replant</code> seeds it, and replaces every record in the database to do so.</p>
</div>
